92f260ce33966","name":"chenyanbin8","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenyanbin8"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168849146,"discussion_id":"b52e232506cd841229acff4719430c94363e1fe5","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复单层LSTM梯度算子内核中的一个数据类型相关的计算错误。该错误在处理变长序列时，计算数据拷贝步长参数使用了硬编码的`FLOAT_BYTES`常量。当模板参数`T`为非`float`类型（如`half`）时，步长计算错误，可能导致数据错位或内存访问越界，属于C++类型安全问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n将`ProcessDhSequenceLengthMask`函数中`dataCopyInSeqParams`参数的`srcStride`字段计算方式，从硬编码的`FLOAT_BYTES`修改为使用`sizeof(T)`。此修改确保了无论模板参数`T`是何种数据类型，数据拷贝的源步长都能根据该类型的实际大小正确计算，从而保证了代码的通用性和内存访问的安全性。","created_at":"2026-04-20T16:27:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-20T16:27:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168849275,"discussion_id":"de390f569277f0c1806968a8bef31ee188daca70","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=9d6b917568e04bbfa0a6b307cbae28e9&projectName=CANN'>9d6b917568e04bbfa0a6b307cbae28e9</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_ubuntu24</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=a59f9587f5e54e438b19e63e4f5546e4&pipelineRunId=9d6b917568e04bbfa0a6b307cbae28e9&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86_mobile_station</s